{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/extras/207c2a02411304791950b766533de58e.poster.avif?t=1769027476\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/extras/207c2a02411304791950b766533de58e.webm?t=1769027476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/extras/207c2a02411304791950b766533de58e.mp4?t=1769027476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Caterpillar King</i>\u00a0is a short turn-based puzzle game wrapped in absurd humor and adorableness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the baby Caterpillar on a 2D grid to his snacks with the help of his chosen family. Push obstacles away to clear a path and swap places with scary enemies to avoid danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/extras/59e60e14d5f4b2d9dde2b3a7ecf47da4.poster.avif?t=1769027476\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/extras/59e60e14d5f4b2d9dde2b3a7ecf47da4.webm?t=1769027476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/extras/59e60e14d5f4b2d9dde2b3a7ecf47da4.mp4?t=1769027476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return the lost child of the Caterpillar King in hopes of receiving a life-changing reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ant leads the charge, but Beetle is feeling hesitant. Can they resolve their differences? Or will they fall into a trap?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/extras/b31423c1e0ac1a7c0379625c827faf3c.poster.avif?t=1769027476\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/extras/b31423c1e0ac1a7c0379625c827faf3c.webm?t=1769027476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/extras/b31423c1e0ac1a7c0379625c827faf3c.mp4?t=1769027476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect something precious</strong> and help the baby Caterpillar reach his snacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge yourself with turn-based puzzles. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy hand-drawn, colorful art</strong> inspired by children\u2019s storybooks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen to a chill soundtrack</strong> while you guide the little Caterpillar home.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916610?t=1769027476","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916610?t=1769027476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/72729503e4f1e32889b53e17d865aafc6d14ba57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769027476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916610/72729503e4f1e32889b53e17d865aafc6d14ba57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769027476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable w